      "cooked": "<p>Just randomly thought I’d poll the community to see if anyone has thoughts about this.  I’m too poor to play any video game that’s being sold in stores, but I am curious, since it’s supposed to be the first 2D Metroid game in over a decade, and Metroid Fusion is one of my absolute favorite games of all time, so it’s at least possible this thing would interest me if I could afford it.</p>",
