      "username": "Surgeon_Cirujano",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/c68b51/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2021-11-02T15:06:27.555Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have always been a big fan of Metroid games, still waiting on new Prime.</p>\n<p>Im still at the beginning on the game but compared to Fusion which is also my favorite non Prime game it has less engaging story elements but gameplay wise is amazing.  It could be that im not far enough into the story but Fusion’s story felt polished from start to finish.  Overall i would still recommend as the game play is smooth and fights remind me of the classics.  and it has the old Metroid trope of Samus forgot all her moves for some reason and now you cant use bomb.  This was the longest game before bomb ever</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-11-02T15:06:27.555Z",
